go to this website----------> install metrics server kubernetes---------------->https://github.com › kubernetes-sigs › metrics-server-------------->
kubectl apply -f https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/metrics-server/releases/latest/download/high-availability-1.21+.yaml---------->ll


now we need to write HPA for a manifest file like below


vim hpa.yml

---
apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
metadata:
  name: myhpa
spec:
  scaleTargetRef:
    apiVersion: apps/v1
    kind: Deployment
    name: pranay
  minReplicas: 2
  maxReplicas: 6
  metrics:
    - type: Resource
      resource:
        name: cpu
        target:
          type: Utilization
          averageUtilization: 60

